save__atom_site.ma_condition_index_1_residue
_item_description.description
;
Residue-level indexed-status request, broadcast per residue. True retains the declared relative token offsets; False leaves placement to the specified insertion policy. Effective files materialize the library default True when consumed. Membership, offsets and model scope are separate from this boolean.
;
_item.name '_atom_site.ma_condition_index_1_residue'
_item.category_id atom_site
_item.mandatory_code no
_item_type.code code
loop_
_item_enumeration.value
True
False
save_

save__atom_site.ma_condition_n_terminus_1_residue
_item_description.description
;
Residue-level N-terminal condition, broadcast per residue. True requests terminal status. False is inactive in the inspected condition API and does not assert a nonterminal constraint. Structure-dependent defaults must be materialized in effective files.
;
_item.name '_atom_site.ma_condition_n_terminus_1_residue'
_item.category_id atom_site
_item.mandatory_code no
_item_type.code code
loop_
_item_enumeration.value
True
False
save_

save__atom_site.ma_condition_c_terminus_1_residue
_item_description.description
;
Residue-level C-terminal condition, broadcast per residue. True requests terminal status. False is inactive in the inspected condition API and does not assert a nonterminal constraint. Structure-dependent defaults must be materialized in effective files.
;
_item.name '_atom_site.ma_condition_c_terminus_1_residue'
_item.category_id atom_site
_item.mandatory_code no
_item_type.code code
loop_
_item_enumeration.value
True
False
save_

save_ma_condition_chain_2_chain
_category.description
;
Symmetric relation between the chain instances containing the two atom indices. True requests the same chain; False is inactive under the inherited boolean mask and must not be interpreted as a different-chain request. Omission is unspecified. Atom-pair broadcasts that refer to the same chain pair must agree. A declared profile must distinguish requests from inferred same-chain defaults. Body order 2; semantic level chain. Indices identify atoms; broadcasts retain the stated level. Composite model/index reference rules are defined in the accompanying contract.
;
_category.id ma_condition_chain_2_chain
_category.mandatory_code no
loop_
_category_key.name
'_ma_condition_chain_2_chain.model_num'
'_ma_condition_chain_2_chain.idx0'
'_ma_condition_chain_2_chain.idx1'
loop_
_category_group.id
inclusive_group
ma_group
save_

