Symmetric relation between the chain instances containing the two atom indices. True requests the same chain; False is inactive under the inherited boolean mask and must not be interpreted as a different-chain request. Omission is unspecified. Atom-pair broadcasts that refer to the same chain pair must agree. A declared profile must distinguish requests from inferred same-chain defaults.
