save__atom_site.ma_condition_hotspot_1_atom
_item_description.description
;
Per-atom interaction-hotspot request. True requests a hotspot; False is inactive, not an anti-hotspot request. The referenced execution profile must define the interaction partner or context and satisfaction criterion.
;
_item.name '_atom_site.ma_condition_hotspot_1_atom'
_item.category_id atom_site
_item.mandatory_code no
_item_type.code code
loop_
_item_enumeration.value
True
False
save_

save__atom_site.ma_condition_rasa_binned_1_atom
_item_description.description
;
Requested relative solvent accessibility bin: 0 inactive, 1 buried, 2 intermediate, 3 exposed. The profile must fix radii, normalization, probe, algorithm and numeric bin boundaries. These names and codes alone do not define a portable measurement.
;
_item.name '_atom_site.ma_condition_rasa_binned_1_atom'
_item.category_id atom_site
_item.mandatory_code no
_item_type.code int
loop_
_item_enumeration.value
0
1
2
3
save_

save__atom_site.ma_condition_hbond_1_atom
_item_description.description
;
Requested hydrogen-bond role: 0 inactive, 1 donor, 2 acceptor, 3 both. The profile must define partner/context and the geometric or chemical criterion.
;
_item.name '_atom_site.ma_condition_hbond_1_atom'
_item.category_id atom_site
_item.mandatory_code no
_item_type.code int
loop_
_item_enumeration.value
0
1
2
3
save_

save__atom_site.ma_condition_pistack_1_atom
_item_description.description
;
Pi-stacking request. True requests the interaction; False is inactive. The profile must define partner/context and the interaction criterion.
;
_item.name '_atom_site.ma_condition_pistack_1_atom'
_item.category_id atom_site
_item.mandatory_code no
_item_type.code code
loop_
_item_enumeration.value
True
False
save_

save__atom_site.ma_condition_pication_1_atom
_item_description.description
;
Requested pi-cation role: 0 inactive, 1 aromatic, 2 cation, 3 both. The profile must define partner/context and the interaction criterion.
;
_item.name '_atom_site.ma_condition_pication_1_atom'
_item.category_id atom_site
_item.mandatory_code no
_item_type.code int
