save__atom_site.ma_condition_saltbridge_1_atom
_item_description.description
;
Requested salt-bridge role: 0 inactive, 1 positive, 2 negative. The profile must define partner/context and the interaction criterion.
;
_item.name '_atom_site.ma_condition_saltbridge_1_atom'
_item.category_id atom_site
_item.mandatory_code no
_item_type.code int
loop_
