save__atom_site.ma_condition_hydrophobic_1_atom
_item_description.description
;
Hydrophobic-contact request. True requests the interaction; False is inactive. The profile must define partner/context and the contact criterion.
;
_item.name '_atom_site.ma_condition_hydrophobic_1_atom'
_item.category_id atom_site
_item.mandatory_code no
_item_type.code code
