save__atom_site.ma_condition_metal_coord_1_atom
_item_description.description
;
Requested metal-coordination role: 0 inactive, 1 metal, 2 coordinating. The profile must define partner/context and the coordination criterion.
;
_item.name '_atom_site.ma_condition_metal_coord_1_atom'
_item.category_id atom_site
_item.mandatory_code no
_item_type.code int
loop_
