save_ma_condition_ChainCentroid_1_atom
_category.description
;
Saved centroid XYZ target in angstroms in the model Cartesian frame, stored per atom. The source featurizer uses an unweighted mean of selected atom targets and can add noise. Preserve saved values, selected contributing atoms and preprocessing provenance; do not recompute away noise or substitute a center of mass. Body order 1; semantic level atom. Indices identify atoms; broadcasts retain the stated level. Composite model/index reference rules are defined in the accompanying contract.
;
_category.id ma_condition_ChainCentroid_1_atom
_category.mandatory_code no
loop_
_category_key.name
'_ma_condition_ChainCentroid_1_atom.model_num'
'_ma_condition_ChainCentroid_1_atom.idx0'
loop_
_category_group.id
inclusive_group
ma_group
save_

