_item_description.description
;
Saved centroid XYZ target in angstroms in the model Cartesian frame, stored per atom. The source featurizer uses an unweighted mean of selected atom targets and can add noise. Preserve saved values, selected contributing atoms and preprocessing provenance; do not recompute away noise or substitute a center of mass. This item is the x component.
;
_item.name '_ma_condition_ChainCentroid_1_atom.val0'
_item.category_id ma_condition_ChainCentroid_1_atom
_item.mandatory_code no
_item_type.code float
_item_units.code angstroms
save_

