save__atom_site.ma_condition_CoordinateGroup_1_atom
_item_description.description
;
Coordinate condition membership: -1 no coordinate condition; 0 absolute target in condition_coordinate; positive integers independently placeable rigid groups with InternalCoordinate targets. Positive IDs are scoped to the model. All group members need finite local targets. CoordinateGroup 0 and absolute-target presence must agree. Whole-group renaming preserves meaning; membership edits require revalidation.
;
_item.name '_atom_site.ma_condition_CoordinateGroup_1_atom'
_item.category_id atom_site
_item.mandatory_code no
_item_type.code int
save_

save_ma_condition_basepair_2_residue
_category.description
;
Symmetric residue-pair condition carried by atom indices. The source enum has 0 unspecified, 1 paired, 2 explicitly unpaired. Required execution needs a versioned profile that defines interpretation. The inspected RFD4 pipeline treats every stored row as positive; therefore rows with 0 or 2 cannot be assumed executable there. Importers must report that ambiguity instead of silently converting it. Body order 2; semantic level residue. Indices identify atoms; broadcasts retain the stated level. Composite model/index reference rules are defined in the accompanying contract.
;
_category.id ma_condition_basepair_2_residue
_category.mandatory_code no
loop_
_category_key.name
'_ma_condition_basepair_2_residue.model_num'
'_ma_condition_basepair_2_residue.idx0'
'_ma_condition_basepair_2_residue.idx1'
loop_
_category_group.id
inclusive_group
ma_group
save_

save__ma_condition_basepair_2_residue.model_num
_item_description.description
;
Model containing all indexed atoms in this row. Required even for a single model.
;
_item.name '_ma_condition_basepair_2_residue.model_num'
_item.category_id ma_condition_basepair_2_residue
_item.mandatory_code yes
_item_type.code int
_item_linked.child_name '_ma_condition_basepair_2_residue.model_num'
_item_linked.parent_name '_ma_model_list.ordinal_id'
save_

