save__atom_site.ma_condition_na_ss_state_1_residue
_item_description.description
;
Residue-level nucleic structural state: 0 inactive, 1 paired, 2 explicitly unpaired. This is a one-body state, not a pair endpoint list. An execution profile must define its expansion into pair constraints and reject conflicts with explicit pair requests.
;
_item.name '_atom_site.ma_condition_na_ss_state_1_residue'
_item.category_id atom_site
_item.mandatory_code no
_item_type.code int
loop_
_item_enumeration.value
0
1
2
